                            ╔═ Change the host ════════════════════════════════════════════╗                            
                            ║ ⚠ Create the user dora with an initial password that must be ║                            
                            ║   changed at the first login.                                ║                            
                            ║                                                              ║                            
                            ║ Admin and Docker rights allow practically everything on this ║                            
                            ║ host. Runs with sudo, goes into the journal and can be       ║                            
                            ║ undone.                                                      ║                            
                            ║ $ useradd -m -d /home/dora -U -s /bin/bash -G sudo,qhost     ║                            
                            ║   dora                                                       ║                            
                            ║ $ chpasswd < <password>                                      ║                            
                            ║ $ chage -d 0 dora                                            ║                            
                            ║ $ [builtin] authorized-keys-add dora < <ssh key              ║                            
